@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Kanji counts by JLPT level plus additional kanji count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kanji/levels

### Kanji for the dictionary or JLPT exercises
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kanji?level=5&offset=0&limit=50

### Additional kanji for dictionary and exercises
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kanji?collection=extra&offset=0&limit=50

### All kanji catalog entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kanji?offset=0&limit=50

### Retrieve a kanji by stable ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kanji/n5-1

### Unknown kanji ID (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kanji/not-a-kanji

### Invalid collection (400 Problem Details)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kanji?collection=other
